  lines:
  - speaker: 
    text: 'You can help be less wasteful by tracking how much you actually waste.
      We can be more mindful about the waste we create. '
  - speaker: 
    text: 'Actions like turning things off when you''re not using things and using
      things less excessively can help reduce waste.  '
